    "type": "html",
    "$t": "<p>&nbsp;</p><h1 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: x-large;\">《Ài好鬥陣，tsiah ē有好人緣》</span><span style=\"font-size: large;\">/</span><span style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">黃明勝</span></span></h1><div><span><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; font-size: xx-large; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEhFlmwPL0K9n19aN9h_bHH4zuupohtpl7sIgfGDpBSeN_xnaU4KXgN11uMkIklo1OD1VqOQEUcC8MI3G8m2TUuowavxhVS4aL7SH3ccv928qYvdtahRDE5MsNb4nWMY5A6WjWQYy07ttTmMXzVRlTR73T2SonIlzPrnMngP4pa8F9XOU-iBBIruWRjOxkWD\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"></a><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEhFlmwPL0K9n19aN9h_bHH4zuupohtpl7sIgfGDpBSeN_xnaU4KXgN11uMkIklo1OD1VqOQEUcC8MI3G8m2TUuowavxhVS4aL7SH3ccv928qYvdtahRDE5MsNb4nWMY5A6WjWQYy07ttTmMXzVRlTR73T2SonIlzPrnMngP4pa8F9XOU-iBBIruWRjOxkWD\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"></a><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEiEsLw6ZCFg8bChQjPuJjX5qRNWZkfg_wvT_ZKiZnRLqn7w62pLYaRZb3IDvs91DwMN4LMK0zM5_MFc807zLnGuek1OQNUkY6fv1GMaLi1kvjXk0ehAEmThXwM67TZJHDtQABVjuiOoh00XIIwd6TGcw_by1mf1jktLUgHoIAjRDQgYmGcwpNgs8JC1bpey\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"></a><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEiEsLw6ZCFg8bChQjPuJjX5qRNWZkfg_wvT_ZKiZnRLqn7w62pLYaRZb3IDvs91DwMN4LMK0zM5_MFc807zLnGuek1OQNUkY6fv1GMaLi1kvjXk0ehAEmThXwM67TZJHDtQABVjuiOoh00XIIwd6TGcw_by1mf1jktLUgHoIAjRDQgYmGcwpNgs8JC1bpey\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"></a><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEi2dE5zb7-w1PTQrNUXICsJgbuf8pmiiS2IzOrb3UbeUfMWdbH9e1Udh8xgYWzCh2xiGmrFhxpp_37YVyo7htOrAXcpoRcmGWEjWdBd_oXql7N61FTzXVCVjJMRQcJ4zMUa1vwYFM88YIR4VOB1Qat2jXZy4q0IdLwsTYvRiEchQU-Zk8DiQGyQv111aouV\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img data-original-height=\"3036\" data-original-width=\"2150\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEggRjON8wD0Yz_oBuPUb39a9Ep0WZbE9TIqEYi2me-ysthTEP5p1dxgtQoDBmhzIAnzYsJHQStoXJhCYaLDKU-gAqttwWmHqbvE-YrljUxzQ824TK0y6AKmO4083g0kqq_FJ5Aumi6ZjRlu7Sjy9u05BGfN1s-PKW988mt2I3KCIfJuyMqBb0TgVscWo__P=w453-h640\" width=\"453\" /></a></span></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em; text-align: center;\"><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEi2dE5zb7-w1PTQrNUXICsJgbuf8pmiiS2IzOrb3UbeUfMWdbH9e1Udh8xgYWzCh2xiGmrFhxpp_37YVyo7htOrAXcpoRcmGWEjWdBd_oXql7N61FTzXVCVjJMRQcJ4zMUa1vwYFM88YIR4VOB1Qat2jXZy4q0IdLwsTYvRiEchQU-Zk8DiQGyQv111aouV\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"></a><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEiHCPoI46zNX2eizjc5-1o1G4Q3MRTMpNfrlshjPTm_PlerGDB4zg6cY_a9KsqR1Mpe-m4w_gi6qHbC9_PfvJLy6MzxMviflyVJnD4hEfZuiLZHxdPC9RiKSyc1WaegdWU-X5hPRejVYj3eHigc8zaAwBsPmCCHspBNQuZ4Jmaf8x3lx0a_FnFFhIB2kD5_\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img data-original-height=\"3036\" data-original-width=\"2150\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEiHCPoI46zNX2eizjc5-1o1G4Q3MRTMpNfrlshjPTm_PlerGDB4zg6cY_a9KsqR1Mpe-m4w_gi6qHbC9_PfvJLy6MzxMviflyVJnD4hEfZuiLZHxdPC9RiKSyc1WaegdWU-X5hPRejVYj3eHigc8zaAwBsPmCCHspBNQuZ4Jmaf8x3lx0a_FnFFhIB2kD5_=w453-h640\" width=\"453\" /></a></div><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEi2dE5zb7-w1PTQrNUXICsJgbuf8pmiiS2IzOrb3UbeUfMWdbH9e1Udh8xgYWzCh2xiGmrFhxpp_37YVyo7htOrAXcpoRcmGWEjWdBd_oXql7N61FTzXVCVjJMRQcJ4zMUa1vwYFM88YIR4VOB1Qat2jXZy4q0IdLwsTYvRiEchQU-Zk8DiQGyQv111aouV\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><br /></a></div></div></div></div><div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">Lán tī社會上leh做khang-khuè，免不了ài kah身邊ê同事鬥陣做代誌。然後，khang-khuè ê配合度kah做伙ê感覺就特別重要，tse mā關係著khang-khuè ê進度是m̄是ē-sái達成kah成功ê因素。所擺，若鬥陣ê phá-nah（partner）能力不止仔好，iáu-m̄-koh人緣tsiânn bái、個性歹鬥陣，lán beh按怎應付--leh？假使家己拄好就是án-ne ê人，beh按怎來改進kah修正？倒píng來講，若鬥陣ê phá-nah能力普普，iáu-m̄-koh人緣tsiânn好、個性tsiânn好鬥陣，kah同事配合kah tsiânn順序，雖bóng能力普通，落尾工作mā ē-sái tī團團圓圓ê氣氛中順序來完成。</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">假使lán是決策者，beh按怎uì tsit兩个去選擇tsiânn做家己ê phá-nah？我leh想，能力kah人際關係lóng是tsiânn重要ê成功因素，iáu-m̄-koh佗一種人tsiah ē tī工作上受歡迎？佗一種人tsiah是同事逐家kah意kah伊鬥陣ê人？當然，有真專業ê智識是tī khang-khuè場頂ài有ê能力，假使欠人際關係ê要素，beh kah客戶、同事溝通suah無法度順利達成，恐驚ē kah好機會sio閃身 。所擺若有專業ê態度，koh-khah ài培養好ê人際關係kah氣度。美國《哈佛商業評論》bat用「人緣」kah「能力」kā人分做四个象限（siōng-hān）：「眾人迷」、「古錐ê阿西」、「精光ê顧人怨」kah「無效ê顧人怨」。</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">「眾人迷」當然就是能力kah人緣lóng tsiânn好ê phá-nah，就án-ne逐家lóng tsiânn歡喜kah伊鬥陣做khang-khuè。Tsit兩項lóng tsiânn bái ê「無效ê顧人怨」，逐家lóng閃to閃bē離、走to走bē離。假使ài tī「古錐ê阿西」kah「精光ê顧人怨」之間選擇，逐个人是m̄是iáu ē-sái tsiânn理性kā工作成果當做第一重要ê項目，tse就tsiânn歹講--ah。</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">企業所做ê研究顯示，「個人感覺」tī選擇中扮演ê角色超過lán ê想像，甚至tsiânn做一種「排斥因素」。有研究suah來發現，假使某一个人ê人緣tsiânn bái，tsit个人是m̄是tsiânn精光根本無重要，橫直無人願意kah伊鬥陣做khang-khuè；不而過顛倒píng，假使一个人tsiânn受逐家歡迎，同事每一位lóng ē盡量揣伊上強ê能力來kah伊合作。也就是講，就鬥陣做khang-khuè tsit項，人緣ê重要性竟然khah贏才調。</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">若拄著「精光ê顧人怨」，逐家通常lóng是保持尊重、mài siunn過親近，而且「古錐ê阿西」雖bóng能力普普，不而過是逐家tsiânn愛kah伊鬥陣ê phá-nah。Uì成功人士ê身--上，koh-khah ē-sái印證人際關係ê重要性。</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">『卡內基美隆』大學（Carnegie Mellon University）bat針對畢業ê 200位傑出校友進行一份問卷調查，結果發現，成功ê重要因素內底，85%是uì一个人ê態度（包括自信kah熱情）、領導、溝通kah人際關係ê能力來--ê，另外ê 15% tsiah是專業智識。就án-ne，beh提升家己ê人緣，tī khang-khuè場受逐家意愛 ，專家提出七種撇步來增加家己ê好人緣，tse就是：</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">1. 歡喜付出kah分享</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">2. 心思tsiânn幼路，tsiânn體貼</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">3. 知影用「同理心」</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">4. 正面思考，bē規日怨嘆</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">5. 有笑詼ê吸引力</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">6. 做有內涵ê「百科全書」</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">7. 有教養kah風度</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">所擺，想beh成功，人際關係ê成份占tsiânn大ê比例，假使ē-sái tsiânn做人人lóng意愛ê「眾人迷」，tsiah ē-sái tī khang-khuè場赤跤ha̍h著鞋。</span></div></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEheiPHFkAqGShp9loyQMHLNVr2XP3eL2YQrCvRqi2OhNHXdITg1lxY85CLb_i7X7KqFMdAAtvs_y18hNW6KhS8u2K-07F6HFpJ5R-G3S_JDT57qpf3tszsERaP1wzHewE3ccUJwLuN6ugYeGLt8bKAtxl6BeernGPRv5vdRD0cTG8JmI-k7jApdtgCDytGX\" style=\"background-color: white; font-family: arial; font-size: large; margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em; text-align: center;\"><img data-original-height=\"729\" data-original-width=\"512\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEheiPHFkAqGShp9loyQMHLNVr2XP3eL2YQrCvRqi2OhNHXdITg1lxY85CLb_i7X7KqFMdAAtvs_y18hNW6KhS8u2K-07F6HFpJ5R-G3S_JDT57qpf3tszsERaP1wzHewE3ccUJw